  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">E-bus fleet acquisition plus carbon finance potential assessment for the city of monterrey, Mexico</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical assistance to Nuevo Le&#xf3;n state government (Metrorrey) to deploy 110 e-buses for public transport, benefitting t 150,000 riders (50% female, 50% male) and avoiding 150,000 tCO2e during project life cycle. A pre-feasibility assessment to structure carbon transactions of this e-bus operation is also delivered.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project delivers demand-led technical assistance to the Nuevo Le&#xf3;n state government (represented by Metrorrey) to acquire 110 electric buses (e-buses), benefitting at least 150,000 daily riders (50% female, 50% male) and avoiding the emission of 150,000 tCO2e during the project&#x2019;s life cycle (15 years). This project also delivers a pre-feasibility assessment conducive to the structuring of a carbon transaction related with said acquisition.</narrative>
  </description>
